5. Why is the ANCOUNT for www.princeton.edu 3, but only 2 IP addresses are
returned?
ANCOUNT counts total resource records in the answer section, not IP addresses,
www.princeton.edu resolves through a CNAME alias chain. The response contains 1
CNAME record, which has no IP address, followed by 2 A records for the target
infrastructure totaling 3 resource records for 2 IPs.

