10. Why do the NS records appear in the Answer section rather than the Authority
section?
The NS records appear in the Answer section rather than the Authority section because
the question asked for the NS records of princeton.edu, and the Answer section holds
records that directly match the queried name and type. The Authority section is for records
that point toward other servers